{
  "name": "obj3_step6c",
  "description": "Objective 3, Step 6 second fix round (all from dev): plural style words (parties), a wedding search tries formal before dropping other filters, dial colours taken from the catalogue (lime, sky blue...), a bare size such as '36 mm' searched exactly, smartwatches and other non-watch items routed to the knowledge path, and a tool call written as text replaced by the fixed staff line. O3-S6 (template questions) only: the 38 shopping single cases and the 40 dev dialogues, both models, Vulkan. About 30-40 minutes.",
